      "post_stream": {
        "posts": [
          {
            "id": 611551,
            "name": "Oktarina",
            "username": "Riena",
            "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/0ea827/{size}.png",
            "created_at": "2026-11-11T04:42:00.367Z",
            "cooked": "<p>I work for the biggest business coaching company in Indonesia.<br>\nI need a freelancer who speaks Bahasa Indonesia fluently &amp; live in the same time zone with Jakarta, Indonesia (GMT+7),  to build one time project of an end-to-end marketing attribution &amp; lead engine that includes:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Direct API ingestion for Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, and YouTube into BigQuery/Supabase via n8n.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>AI-powered schema standardization and lead scoring (Hot/Warm/Cold).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Phone/email deduplication lookup &amp; round-robin lead rotator.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Multi-touch customer journey database logging touchpoints over time.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Outbound WhatsApp integration via Mekari Qontak or WAHA HTTP API endpoints.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Looker Studio dashboard displaying aggregated CPM, CTR, CPL, CPLPV, CPP, and ROAS.</p>\n<p>Project Brief: Multi-Channel Marketing Attribution &amp; Automated Lead Engine</p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-611551-h-1-objective-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-611551-h-1-objective-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>1. Objective</h2>\n<p>Build an automated data pipeline, lead deduplication engine, lead scoring, multi-touch journey tracker, and WhatsApp notification workflow using self-hosted n8n, an AI Agent node, a relational database (Google BigQuery or Supabase), and Looker Studio.</p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-611551-h-2-key-scope-deliverables-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-611551-h-2-key-scope-deliverables-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>2. Key Scope &amp; Deliverables</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Ad Data Ingestion Pipeline (Bypassing Supermetrics):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Configure scheduled n8n workflows pulling spend, impressions, clicks, CPM, and CTR directly via platform REST APIs (Meta Insights, TikTok Marketing, LinkedIn Ads, YouTube Data API).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>AI Schema Standardization &amp; Lead Scoring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Implement an LLM API node (OpenAI/Claude) in n8n to unify ad metrics into a single database schema and parse UTM parameters.</li>\n<li>Configure lead scoring rules to grade lead quality (Hot/Warm/Cold) based on platform origin, ad set metadata, and form values.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Phone &amp; Email Deduplication + Smart Rotator:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>On incoming lead submission (formulir.id / web form):\n<ul>\n<li>Query database by <code>phone_number</code> and <code>email</code>.</li>\n<li>IF lead exists: Route to existing assigned sales rep.</li>\n<li>IF new lead: Assign to sales reps via weighted round-robin based on lead score.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Multi-Touch Journey Logging:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Design an event-based database schema tracking interactions over time (e.g., Nov 2026 IG ad → Jan 2027 WA outreach → Feb 2027 LinkedIn purchase) to calculate true CPL, CPLPV, CPP, and ROAS.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>WhatsApp Messaging Integration:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Build outbound HTTP API triggers connecting n8n to Mekari Qontak API or self-hosted WAHA (WhatsApp HTTP API) for immediate auto-replies and automated broadcast sequences.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Visualization Dashboard:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Connect BigQuery/Supabase to Google Looker Studio displaying unified top-of-funnel and bottom-of-funnel performance.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2><a name=\"p-611551-h-3-required-technical-stack-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-611551-h-3-required-technical-stack-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>3. Required Technical Stack</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Orchestration: Self-hosted n8n (Docker container on VPS)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>AI Node: OpenAI GPT-4o / Anthropic API</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Database: Google BigQuery or Supabase</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Dashboard: Google Looker Studio</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>WhatsApp API: Mekari Qontak Open API / WAHA (WhatsApp HTTP API)</p>\n<p>Could you share your estimated hours, scope, and availability for this project? Kindly contact me through email at <a href=\"mailto:oktarina.nurhayati@gratyo.id\">oktarina.nurhayati@gratyo.id</a>.</p>\n<p>Thank you <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/slight_smile.png?v=16\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><small><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/information_source.png?v=16\" title=\":information_source:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":information_source:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Replies are closed - contact the author using email, application form or direct message. Read more <a href=\"https://community.n8n.io/t/jobs-category-guidelines-posting-and-applying/941\">here</a>.</small></p>",
